{"event": "register", "file": "harness/strategies/dated_carry.py", "is_benchmark": false, "name": "dated_carry", "params": {"band": 0.6, "basis_gate": 0.08, "expiry_hour_utc": 8, "notional": 0.6666666666666666, "roundtrip_fees": 0.003}, "pass_criteria": [{"benchmark": "bh_btc", "fee": 0.001, "metric": "sharpe", "op": ">=", "split": "dev"}, {"benchmark": "bh_btc", "factor": 0.6, "fee": 0.001, "metric": "max_dd", "op": "<=", "split": "dev"}, {"fee": 0.001, "metric": "after_tax_cagr", "op": ">=", "split": "dev", "value": 0.05}, {"fee": 0.001, "metric": "after_tax_cagr", "op": ">", "split": "holdout", "value": 0.0}, {"fee": 0.001, "metric": "max_dd", "op": "<=", "split": "holdout", "value": 0.35}], "prev": "01fbc5d76f5e59930e7ae913e6417006522e552eba0f183ebff90832e6e9edea", "rule": "Each day, for the current quarterly contract (expiry E = last Friday of Mar/Jun/Sep/Dec, 08:00 UTC), gate on day d = ((F/S - 1) - 0.003) * 365 / days_to_expiry >= 0.08, with F and S the CQ:BTCUSDT and BTCUSDT closes of day d-1, days_to_expiry = (E - d) + 8/24, and 0.003 = round-trip fees (spot 0.1% x 2 + futures 0.05% x 2). If the gate has held on any day since this contract became current (day after the previous expiry), hold long spot BTC 2/3 of capital and short CQ:BTCUSDT 2/3 of capital (same notional, 1/3 of capital = 50% of notional kept as futures collateral in cash); hold to expiry with no rebalancing (band 0.6); flatten both legs at the expiry-day open (8 h before settlement); otherwise cash. Returns are on total capital.", "seq": 20, "sha256": "7c5f4a5c5f8b7b1ad5b93bc9df72078e0ec2da6439285e625d1bad7f2ac3a99f", "ts": "2026-10-03T19:35:22+00:00", "universe": ["BTCUSDT", "CQ:BTCUSDT"]}
{"event": "register", "file": "harness/strategies/xs_mom10.py", "is_benchmark": false, "name": "xs_mom10", "params": {"band": 0.02, "btc_sma": 200, "lookback": 90, "slot": 0.1, "top": 10}, "pass_criteria": [{"benchmark": "bh_btc", "fee": 0.001, "metric": "sharpe", "op": ">=", "split": "dev"}, {"benchmark": "bh_btc", "factor": 0.6, "fee": 0.001, "metric": "max_dd", "op": "<=", "split": "dev"}, {"fee": 0.001, "metric": "after_tax_cagr", "op": ">=", "split": "dev", "value": 0.05}, {"fee": 0.001, "metric": "after_tax_cagr", "op": ">", "split": "holdout", "value": 0.0}, {"fee": 0.001, "metric": "max_dd", "op": "<=", "split": "holdout", "value": 0.35}], "prev": "c01bed3050e01beac2d095b8ed0d7aa1b62d666112afb2b89ab5a4c2a18194e1", "rule": "On the first day of each month (UTC), using closes before that day's open: if BTCUSDT's last close <= its 200-day SMA, hold all cash for the month. Otherwise rank the 30 universe coins that were tradeable and had >= 91 daily closes by 90-day return (last close / close 90 days earlier - 1; ties by symbol), take the top 10 and keep only those with a positive return; each kept coin gets 10% of equity, unfilled slots stay in cash. Between month starts the target is the weight each holding has drifted to since the month-start open (no intra-month trading); band 0.02; a held coin that stops trading is set to 0.", "seq": 21, "sha256": "b97d93fd3dcc789e7f33f530e1d38a746a247b0a4dfae6770b1ee54e996bb0ae", "ts": "2026-10-03T19:35:22+00:00", "universe": ["BTCUSDT", "ETHUSDT", "SOLUSDT", "ZECUSDT", "XRPUSDT", "WLDUSDT", "BNBUSDT", "NEARUSDT", "SUIUSDT", "SANDUSDT", "QNTUSDT", "UNIUSDT", "AVAXUSDT", "DOGEUSDT", "LTCUSDT", "AAVEUSDT", "LINKUSDT", "ADAUSDT", "MOVRUSDT", "TRXUSDT", "FETUSDT", "ONEUSDT", "PEPEUSDT", "SUPERUSDT", "DOTUSDT", "GLMRUSDT", "INJUSDT", "ARBUSDT", "MANAUSDT", "GALAUSDT"]}
